{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09687","headline":"醉题匡城周少府厅壁 · 岑参","name":"醉题匡城周少府厅壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妇姑城南风雨秋，妇姑城中人独愁。\n愁云遮却望乡处，数日不上西南楼。\n故人薄暮公事闲，玉壶美酒琥珀殷。\n颍阳秋草今黄尽，醉卧君家犹未还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}